:"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"You have the mask?","TextSheVersion":"You have the mask?","TextTheyVersion":"You have the mask?"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":0,"name":"Unspecified"},"position":{"x":1600.0,"y":325.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"48379","byteOffset":32638552,"byteLength":328}},{"id":"DFr_B65A0156","articyId":"72057606922879319","type":"choice","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Player","text":"We sent you the funds. You have them, right?","speakerId":"Ntt_4A96A8B1","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"We sent you the funds. You have them, right?","TextSheVersion":"We sent you the funds. You have them, right?","TextTheyVersion":"We sent you the funds. You have them, right?"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":0,"name":"Unspecified"},"position":{"x":1600.0,"y":575.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"40857","byteOffset":29783360,"byteLength":352}},{"id":"DFr_B98FF70B","articyId":"72057606922879326","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Idlehands","text":"Sure. Ya see back when I got Raluca's mask two years ago, I actually got a spare mask. Had it the whole time.","speakerId":"Ntt_52277EAC","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"Sure. Ya see back when I got Raluca's mask two years ago, I actually got a spare mask. Had it the whole time.","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":0,"name":"Unspecified"},"position":{"x":1900.0,"y":450.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"32984","byteOffset":20363288,"byteLength":420}},{"id":"DFr_AA0357A5","articyId":"72057606922879334","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Idlehands","text":"I held on to it. That's good business ya see. You could learn a thing or two from me. For example, you're learning a pretty big lesson right now.","speakerId":"Ntt_52277EAC","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"I held on to it. That's good business ya see. You could learn a thing or two from me. For example, you're learning a pretty big lesson right now.","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":0,"name":"Unspecified"},"position":{"x":2200.0,"y":450.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"42030","byteOffset":30227224,"byteLength":492}},{"id":"DFr_3A11C1F5","articyId":"72057606922879341","type":"choice","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Player","text":"You had it all along?","speakerId":"Ntt_4A96A8B1","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"You had it all along?","TextSheVersion":"You had it all along?","TextTheyVersion":"You had it all along?"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":0,"name":"Unspecified"},"position":{"x":2500.0,"y":325.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"21294","byteOffset":15942768,"byteLength":332}},{"id":"DFr_44E4A098","articyId":"72057606922879348","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Idlehands","text":"If ya hadn't hit the target, I still would have given the boy the mask, and taken whatever you had. But what can I say? You're a top-rate fundraiser!","speakerId":"Ntt_52277EAC","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"If ya hadn't hit the target, I still would have given the boy the mask, and taken whatever you had. But what can I say? You're a top-rate fundraiser!","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":3,"name":"Happy"},"position":{"x":2800.0,"y":575.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"18674","byteOffset":14951256,"byteLength":496}},{"id":"DFr_955293FE","articyId":"72057606922879355","type":"choice","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Player","text":"You played us all, you asshole!","speakerId":"Ntt_4A96A8B1","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"You played us all, you asshole!","TextSheVersion":"You played us all, you asshole!","TextTheyVersion":"You played us all, you asshole!"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":0,"name":"Unspecified"},"position":{"x":3100.0,"y":325.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"29251","byteOffset":18947320,"byteLength":340}},{"id":"DFr_50003558","articyId":"72057606922879369","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Idlehands","text":"Nah. This is a triumph for hope, spirit, charity... and all that STUFF. But also business! People gave a damn, and I cleared my stock. Everyone wins.","speakerId":"Ntt_52277EAC","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"Nah. This is a triumph for hope, spirit, charity... and all that STUFF. But also business! People gave a damn, and I cleared my stock. Everyone wins.","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":5,"name":"Smile"},"position":{"x":3400.0,"y":450.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"43465","byteOffset":30773248,"byteLength":460}},{"id":"DFr_379D3234","articyId":"72057606922879376","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Idlehands","text":"Gives you hope. Gives me hope. I think we did good here. Everything worked out!","speakerId":"Ntt_52277EAC","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"Gives you hope. Gives me hope. I think we did good here. Everything worked out!","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":3,"name":"Happy"},"position":{"x":3700.0,"y":450.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"24793","byteOffset":17259416,"byteLength":424}},{"id":"DFr_086C5305","articyId":"72057606922879383","type":"choice","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Player","text":"Right... Will you give them the mask?","speakerId":"Ntt_4A96A8B1","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"Right... Will you give them the mask?","TextSheVersion":"Right... Will you give them the mask?","TextTheyVersion":"Right... Will you give them the mask?"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":0,"name":"Unspecified"},"position":{"x":4000.0,"y":325.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"36154","byteOffset":28024520,"byteLength":348}},{"id":"DFr_E7709082","articyId":"72057606922879390","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Idlehands","text":"The boy already got it! My runner dropped it off at their house. It's a Nivalis miracle! If you see the kid, tell him I said \"Hi\".","speakerId":"Ntt_52277EAC","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"The boy already got it! My runner dropped it off at their house. It's a Nivalis miracle! If you see the kid, tell him I said \"Hi\".","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":3,"name":"Happy"},"position":{"x":4300.0,"y":450.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"23080","byteOffset":16616704,"byteLength":440}},{"id":"DFr_16577A98","articyId":"72057834556101357","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Idlehands","text":"Now... A rising tide raises all ships and all that. I'm off to reinvest my profits at the bar. And the economy chugs on! Cheers my friend. See ya around.","speakerId":"Ntt_52277EAC","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"Now... A rising tide raises all ships and all that. I'm off to reinvest my profits at the bar. And the economy chugs on! Cheers my friend. See ya around.","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":3,"name":"Happy"},"position":{"x":4600.0,"y":450.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"28184","byteOffset":18544496,"byteLength":500}},{"id":"DFr_C53D3051","articyId":"72057821671323692","type":"choice","className":"DemeanorTempl